# StationViz: large SCD fixtures. These exist only to prove parse performance
# on a big document (~19 MB total) and are not needed to build or run the app.
# Restore them locally if you want to run the stress fixtures:
#   tests/scl_sld_demo/data/SCD_HEAVY_{SMALL,LARGE}.scd
# The batch runner skips any manifest entry whose file is absent.
*.scd.large
